<title>USA: Nebraska fed cattle thin at $116/dressed - USDA.</title>
<headline>Nebraska fed cattle thin at $116/dressed - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade at a virtual standstill on Tuesday morning, USDA said. Steers and heifers were not established on a dressed basis delivered (paid on hot carcass weights), USDA said.</p>
<p>Dressed Basis Steers:  No confirmed sales. Dressed Basis Heifers: Few Select and Choice 2-3 1150 lbs 116.00.</p>
<p>Prices on slaughter steers and heifers not established on a live basis. Buyer and seller interest very light.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers:  No confirmed sales.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers: No confirmed sales.</p>
<p>Sales confirmed:  200  For the week: 2,100</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
